significat jacit, unde dissip[at, dejicit
et obsipat, obicit, et insipat] insipit <NOTE N="21" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1665"></COL> injicit.</NOTE> .
. . . . . . . . inicit far in olam <NOTE N="22" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1665"></COL> ollam.</NOTE> .
¶ Sutelae, dolosae] assutiae, a similitudine
suentium di]ctae] sunt. ¶ Suspectus
est diversae] significationis:
a suspicor enim,] et suspicio partim
