Precationes.</ITEM> <ITEM>Aurelius Opilius, 12, 14,
21, 66, 83, 126, 140, 149,
163, 169, 188, 195.</ITEM> <CAPTION COM="1709">C</CAPTION> <ITEM>Caecilius 38, 65.—In Aethrione,
20, 32, 145.—In
Anagnorizomene, 107.—In
Androgyno, 125 (?), 189.—In
